{%- comment -%}
----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
SERIES PAGE (templates/metaobject/series.json, every /pages/series/<handle> page)
----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

One section, driven entirely by the series metaobject, so the same template serves every series. Its blocks (hero,
books, characters, about) can be reordered or removed in the theme editor. Layout and copy: design canvas
"Series Page Mockup" (Pippi Longstocking).

Where everything comes from:
* The books: the series' optional `books` field (a list of products, in reading order). Without it, the products in
  the series' `collection` that are linked to an audiobook entry (book.audiobook), in the collection's own order.
  Bundles, starter packs and anything else in the collection are left out.
* Numbers ("Book 1", "Start with book 1") only when the series has a `books` list AND its `reading_order` field is on:
  a best-selling collection order is not a reading order.
* Authors, narrators, characters, reading age, key stage, ATOS level and genres: gathered from each book's audiobook
  entry, duplicates removed.
* Hero line: the series' `tagline` field, else its `page_description`.
* Character boxes: each character's first photo, or its initials (snippets/person-avatar.liquid) when it has none.
* Hero pills and Good to know: authors and narrators link to their page (else their collection); reading age links to
  the age collection holding the youngest reading age; genres link through the section's "Genre links" list
  (genre | pill label | collection), and a genre pill shows only for genres the series' books carry. The age handles
  and genre list are section settings, shared by both blocks. The book count links to the books list.
* Hero colour: the series' `colour` field, else the block setting. Text turns white on a dark colour.
* "The whole series": the series' `bundle` field (a product), else a product in the collection whose title holds the
  series name and "Audiobook Bundle" (static "-set" copies are skipped). The saving shown is the bundle's books bought
  singly minus the bundle price, and only when there is a saving. With no bundle, an "Add all to basket" form adds
  every available book.
* Optional fields (`books`, `reading_order`, `tagline`, `colour`, `bundle`) can be added to the Series definition at
  any time; until then every part falls back as above.

Tracking: PostHog event series_page_click { target, series, product } on the hero buttons and pills, bundle, add all,
book links and related series. Sample plays are already tracked globally as sample_played (assets/voxblock.js).
{%- endcomment -%}

{%- liquid
  assign series = metaobject
  assign series_name = series.name.value | default: series.system.handle
  assign series_handle = series.system.handle
  assign series_collection = series.collection.value

  assign source_books = series.books.value
  assign has_book_list = false
  if source_books != blank
    assign has_book_list = true
  elsif series_collection != blank
    assign source_books = series_collection.products
  endif

  assign numbered = false
  if has_book_list and series.reading_order.value == true
    assign numbered = true
  endif

  assign book_count = 0
  assign first_book = nil
  assign hero_sample_book = nil
  assign books_total_cents = 0
  assign available_count = 0
  assign author_keys = '|'
  assign author_names = ''
  assign author_urls = ''
  assign narrator_urls = ''
  assign narrator_keys = '|'
  assign narrator_names = ''
  assign narrator_count = 0
  assign reading_levels = ''
  assign key_stages = ''
  assign genres = ''
  assign character_count = 0
  assign character_keys = '|'
  assign atos_min = 99.0
  assign atos_max = 0.0
  assign atos_min_text = ''
  assign atos_max_text = ''

  for book in source_books
    assign audiobook = book.metafields.book.audiobook.value
    if has_book_list == false and audiobook == blank
      continue
    endif
    assign book_count = book_count | plus: 1
    if first_book == nil
      assign first_book = book
    endif
    if hero_sample_book == nil and book.metafields.book.preview != blank
      assign hero_sample_book = book
    endif
    if book.available
      assign available_count = available_count | plus: 1
      assign books_total_cents = books_total_cents | plus: book.selected_or_first_available_variant.price
    endif

    for author in audiobook.authors.value
      assign key = '|' | append: author.system.handle | append: '|'
      unless author_keys contains key
        assign author_keys = author_keys | append: author.system.handle | append: '|'
        assign author_names = author_names | append: author.name.value | append: '##'
        assign link = author.system.url
        if link == blank and author.collection.value != blank
          assign link = author.collection.value.url
        endif
        if link == blank
          assign link = '-'
        endif
        assign author_urls = author_urls | append: link | append: '##'
      endunless
    endfor
    for narrator in audiobook.narrators.value
      assign key = '|' | append: narrator.system.handle | append: '|'
      unless narrator_keys contains key
        assign narrator_keys = narrator_keys | append: narrator.system.handle | append: '|'
        assign narrator_names = narrator_names | append: narrator.name.value | append: '##'
        assign link = narrator.system.url
        if link == blank and narrator.collection.value != blank
          assign link = narrator.collection.value.url
        endif
        if link == blank
          assign link = '-'
        endif
        assign narrator_urls = narrator_urls | append: link | append: '##'
        assign narrator_count = narrator_count | plus: 1
      endunless
    endfor
    for character in audiobook.characters.value
      assign key = '|' | append: character.system.handle | append: '|'
      unless character_keys contains key
        assign character_keys = character_keys | append: character.system.handle | append: '|'
        assign character_count = character_count | plus: 1
      endunless
    endfor
    for level in audiobook.reading_level.value
      assign reading_levels = reading_levels | append: level | append: '##'
    endfor
    assign stage = audiobook.key_stage.value | remove: '"' | strip
    if stage != blank
      assign key_stages = key_stages | append: stage | append: '##'
    endif
    for genre in audiobook.genres.value
      assign genres = genres | append: genre | append: '##'
    endfor
    assign atos_text = audiobook.atos_book_level.value | strip
    if atos_text != blank
      assign atos = atos_text | plus: 0.0
      if atos > 0
        if atos < atos_min
          assign atos_min = atos
          assign atos_min_text = atos_text
        endif
        if atos > atos_max
          assign atos_max = atos
          assign atos_max_text = atos_text
        endif
      endif
    endif
  endfor

  assign author_list = author_names | split: '##'
  assign narrator_list = narrator_names | split: '##'
  assign author_url_list = author_urls | split: '##'
  assign narrator_url_list = narrator_urls | split: '##'
  assign reading_level_list = reading_levels | split: '##' | uniq
  assign key_stage_list = key_stages | split: '##' | uniq
  assign genre_list = genres | split: '##' | uniq

  assign atos_label = ''
  if atos_min_text != blank
    assign atos_label = atos_min_text
    if atos_max_text != atos_min_text
      assign atos_label = atos_min_text | append: '–' | append: atos_max_text
    endif
  endif

  # "Ages 6-9 Years" style label from the first reading level ("6-9 Years" -> "6–9")
  assign age_label = ''
  if reading_level_list.size > 0
    assign age_label = reading_level_list.first | downcase | remove: 'years' | remove: 'year' | strip | replace: '-', '–'
  endif

  # Links shared by the hero pills and the facts panel (section settings)
  # Age: the age collection holding the youngest reading age (6-9 -> the 5 to 8 collection)
  assign age_handle = ''
  if age_label != blank
    assign age_from = age_label | split: '–' | first | strip | plus: 0
    if age_from < 5
      assign age_handle = section.settings.age_under_5
    elsif age_from < 8
      assign age_handle = section.settings.age_5_8
    elsif age_from < 10
      assign age_handle = section.settings.age_8_10
    else
      assign age_handle = section.settings.age_10_up
    endif
    assign age_handle = age_handle | strip
  endif
  # Genres: "genre | pill label | collection handle", one per line
  assign genre_lines = section.settings.genre_links | newline_to_br | split: '<br />'
  assign books_anchor = ''
  for b in section.blocks
    if b.type == 'books' and book_count > 0
      assign books_anchor = '#series-books-' | append: section.id
    endif
  endfor

  # The whole-series bundle
  assign bundle = series.bundle.value
  if bundle == blank and series_collection != blank
    assign name_key = series_name | downcase
    for candidate in series_collection.products
      assign candidate_title = candidate.title | downcase
      assign tail = candidate.handle | slice: -4, 4
      if candidate.available and tail != '-set' and candidate_title contains name_key and candidate_title contains 'audiobook bundle'
        assign bundle = candidate
        break
      endif
    endfor
  endif
  assign bundle_singles_cents = 0
  assign bundle_book_count = 0
  if bundle != blank
    for part in bundle.metafields.bundles.products.value
      assign bundle_singles_cents = bundle_singles_cents | plus: part.price
      assign bundle_book_count = bundle_book_count | plus: 1
    endfor
  endif
  assign bundle_saving_cents = 0
  if bundle != blank and bundle_singles_cents > bundle.price
    assign bundle_saving_cents = bundle_singles_cents | minus: bundle.price
  endif

  assign hero_line = series.tagline.value | default: series.page_description.value
-%}

<div class="series-page" data-series="{{ series_handle | escape }}" {{ section.shopify_attributes }}>
  {%- for block in section.blocks -%}
    {%- case block.type -%}

      {%- when 'hero' -%}
        {%- liquid
          assign hero_bg = series.colour.value | default: block.settings.background
          assign hero_ink = '#1e2b2c'
          assign hero_ink_soft = 'rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.72)'
          assign hero_is_dark = false
          assign hero_brightness = hero_bg | color_brightness
          if hero_brightness < 140
            assign hero_ink = '#ffffff'
            assign hero_ink_soft = 'rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.16)'
            assign hero_is_dark = true
          endif
          assign eyebrow = block.settings.eyebrow | replace: '[count]', book_count

          if book_count == 1
            assign eyebrow = block.settings.eyebrow_one
          endif
        -%}
        <section class="series-hero{% if hero_is_dark %} series-hero--dark{% endif %}" style="--series-hero-bg: {{ hero_bg }}; --series-hero-ink: {{ hero_ink }}; --series-chip-bg: {{ hero_ink_soft }};" {{ block.shopify_attributes }}>
          <div class="container series-hero__inner">
            <div class="series-hero__text">
              {%- if eyebrow != blank -%}<p class="series-hero__eyebrow">{{ eyebrow | escape }}</p>{%- endif -%}
              <h1 class="series-hero__title">{{ series_name | escape }}</h1>
              {%- if hero_line != blank -%}<p class="series-hero__lede">{{ hero_line | escape }}</p>{%- endif -%}

              <ul class="series-hero__chips" role="list">
                {%- for name in author_list -%}
                  {%- assign link = author_url_list[forloop.index0] -%}
                  <li>
                    {%- if link != blank and link != '-' -%}
                      <a href="{{ link }}" class="series-chip series-chip--link" data-series-target="pill_author">{{ block.settings.by_label | escape }} {{ name | escape }}</a>
                    {%- else -%}
                      <span class="series-chip">{{ block.settings.by_label | escape }} {{ name | escape }}</span>
                    {%- endif -%}
                  </li>
                {%- endfor -%}
                {%- if narrator_count <= 2 -%}
                  {%- for name in narrator_list -%}
                    {%- assign link = narrator_url_list[forloop.index0] -%}
                    <li>
                      {%- if link != blank and link != '-' -%}
                        <a href="{{ link }}" class="series-chip series-chip--link" data-series-target="pill_narrator">{{ block.settings.read_by_label | escape }} {{ name | escape }}</a>
                      {%- else -%}
                        <span class="series-chip">{{ block.settings.read_by_label | escape }} {{ name | escape }}</span>
                      {%- endif -%}
                    </li>
                  {%- endfor -%}
                {%- endif -%}
                {%- if age_label != blank -%}
                  <li>
                    {%- if age_handle != blank -%}
                      <a href="{{ routes.collections_url }}/{{ age_handle | strip }}" class="series-chip series-chip--link" data-series-target="pill_age">{{ block.settings.ages_label | escape }} {{ age_label | escape }}</a>
                    {%- else -%}
                      <span class="series-chip">{{ block.settings.ages_label | escape }} {{ age_label | escape }}</span>
                    {%- endif -%}
                  </li>
                {%- endif -%}
                {%- for line in genre_lines -%}
                  {%- assign parts = line | strip | split: '|' -%}
                  {%- if parts.size < 3 -%}{%- continue -%}{%- endif -%}
                  {%- assign genre_name = parts[0] | strip -%}
                  {%- unless genre_list contains genre_name -%}{%- continue -%}{%- endunless -%}
                  <li><a href="{{ routes.collections_url }}/{{ parts[2] | strip }}" class="series-chip series-chip--link" data-series-target="pill_genre">{{ parts[1] | strip | escape }}</a></li>
                {%- endfor -%}
              </ul>

              <div class="series-hero__actions">
                {%- if book_count > 0 -%}
                  {%- if numbered -%}
                    {%- assign start_label = block.settings.start_numbered_label -%}
                  {%- else -%}
                    {%- assign start_label = block.settings.start_label -%}
                  {%- endif -%}
                  <a href="#series-books-{{ section.id }}" class="series-button series-button--primary" data-series-target="hero_books">{{ start_label | escape }}</a>
                {%- endif -%}
                {%- if hero_sample_book != blank -%}
                  <button type="button" class="bookpreview series-button series-button--secondary" aria-controls="product-sample" aria-expanded="false" data-mp3="{{ hero_sample_book.metafields.book.preview | file_url }}" data-title="{{ hero_sample_book.title | escape }}">
                    <span class="playpause" aria-hidden="true"></span>
                    <span class="series-button__label">{{ block.settings.sample_label | escape }}</span>
                  </button>
                {%- endif -%}
              </div>
            </div>

            {%- if book_count > 0 -%}
              <div class="series-hero__covers" aria-hidden="true">
                {%- assign shown = 0 -%}
                {%- for book in source_books -%}
                  {%- if has_book_list == false and book.metafields.book.audiobook.value == blank -%}{%- continue -%}{%- endif -%}
                  {%- if book.featured_media == blank -%}{%- continue -%}{%- endif -%}
                  {%- assign shown = shown | plus: 1 -%}
                  <div class="series-hero__cover series-hero__cover--{{ shown }}">
                    {{- book.featured_media | image_url: width: 420 | image_tag: loading: 'eager', sizes: '(max-width: 699px) 28vw, 190px', widths: '120,190,240,380,420', alt: '' -}}
                  </div>
                  {%- if shown == 3 -%}{%- break -%}{%- endif -%}
                {%- endfor -%}
              </div>
            {%- endif -%}
          </div>
        </section>

      {%- when 'books' -%}
        {%- if book_count > 0 -%}
          {%- liquid
            if numbered
              assign books_heading = block.settings.heading_numbered
              assign books_intro = block.settings.intro_numbered
            else
              assign books_heading = block.settings.heading
              assign books_intro = block.settings.intro
            endif
            assign books_intro = books_intro | replace: '[count]', book_count
            if narrator_count == 1 and block.settings.narrator_line != blank
              assign narrator_line = block.settings.narrator_line | replace: '[narrator]', narrator_list.first
              assign books_intro = books_intro | append: ' ' | append: narrator_line | strip
            endif
          -%}
          <section id="series-books-{{ section.id }}" class="series-books" {{ block.shopify_attributes }}>
            <div class="container">
              <div class="series-books__head">
                <div class="series-books__head-text">
                  <h2 class="series-heading">{{ books_heading | escape }}</h2>
                  {%- if books_intro != blank -%}<p class="series-books__intro">{{ books_intro | escape }}</p>{%- endif -%}
                </div>

                {%- if bundle != blank -%}
                  <div class="series-whole">
                    <div class="series-whole__text">
                      <p class="series-whole__title">{{ block.settings.bundle_label | escape }}</p>
                      <p class="series-whole__meta">
                        {%- if bundle_book_count > 0 -%}{{ block.settings.bundle_count_label | replace: '[count]', bundle_book_count | escape }} · {% endif -%}
                        <span class="series-whole__price">{{ bundle.price | money }}</span>
                        {%- if bundle_saving_cents > 0 %} · <span class="series-whole__saving">{{ block.settings.saving_label | escape }}{{ bundle_saving_cents | money }}</span>{%- endif -%}
                      </p>
                    </div>
                    <a href="{{ bundle.url }}" class="series-button series-button--primary series-button--small" data-series-target="bundle" data-series-product="{{ bundle.handle | escape }}">{{ block.settings.bundle_button | escape }}</a>
                  </div>
                {%- elsif available_count > 1 -%}
                  <form action="{{ routes.cart_add_url }}" method="post" class="series-whole">
                    {%- assign item_index = 0 -%}
                    {%- for book in source_books -%}
                      {%- if has_book_list == false and book.metafields.book.audiobook.value == blank -%}{%- continue -%}{%- endif -%}
                      {%- unless book.available -%}{%- continue -%}{%- endunless -%}
                      <input type="hidden" name="items[{{ item_index }}][id]" value="{{ book.selected_or_first_available_variant.id }}">
                      <input type="hidden" name="items[{{ item_index }}][quantity]" value="1">
                      {%- assign item_index = item_index | plus: 1 -%}
                    {%- endfor -%}
                    <div class="series-whole__text">
                      <p class="series-whole__title">{{ block.settings.bundle_label | escape }}</p>
                      <p class="series-whole__meta">{{ block.settings.bundle_count_label | replace: '[count]', available_count | escape }} · <span class="series-whole__price">{{ books_total_cents | money }}</span></p>
                    </div>
                    <button type="submit" class="series-button series-button--primary series-button--small" data-series-target="add_all">{{ block.settings.add_all_button | replace: '[count]', available_count | escape }}</button>
                  </form>
                {%- endif -%}
              </div>

              <ol class="series-books__list" role="list">
                {%- assign position = 0 -%}
                {%- for book in source_books -%}
                  {%- assign audiobook = book.metafields.book.audiobook.value -%}
                  {%- if has_book_list == false and audiobook == blank -%}{%- continue -%}{%- endif -%}
                  {%- assign position = position | plus: 1 -%}
                  {%- liquid
                    assign blurb = audiobook.concise_blurb | metafield_text | strip
                    if blurb == blank
                      assign blurb = audiobook.short_blurb | metafield_text | strip
                    endif
                    if blurb == blank
                      assign blurb = book.description | strip_html | strip
                    endif
                    assign book_narrators = ''
                    for narrator in audiobook.narrators.value
                      unless forloop.first
                        assign book_narrators = book_narrators | append: ' & '
                      endunless
                      assign book_narrators = book_narrators | append: narrator.name.value
                    endfor
                    assign book_age = audiobook.reading_level.value | first | downcase | remove: 'years' | remove: 'year' | strip | replace: '-', '–'
                  -%}
                  <li class="series-book">
                    <div class="series-book__media">
                      <a href="{{ book.url }}" tabindex="-1" aria-hidden="true" data-series-target="book_image" data-series-product="{{ book.handle | escape }}">
                        {%- if book.featured_media -%}
                          {{- book.featured_media | image_url: width: 300 | image_tag: loading: 'lazy', sizes: '(max-width: 699px) 88px, 120px', widths: '88,120,176,240,300', alt: '' -}}
                        {%- endif -%}
                      </a>
                      {%- if numbered -%}<span class="series-book__number" aria-hidden="true">{{ position }}</span>{%- endif -%}
                    </div>

                    <div class="series-book__body">
                      {%- if numbered -%}
                        <p class="series-book__eyebrow">{{ block.settings.book_label | replace: '[n]', position | escape }}{% if position == 1 %} · {{ block.settings.start_here_label | escape }}{% endif %}</p>
                      {%- endif -%}
                      <h3 class="series-book__title"><a href="{{ book.url }}" data-series-target="book_title" data-series-product="{{ book.handle | escape }}">{{ book.title | escape }}</a></h3>
                      {%- if blurb != blank -%}<p class="series-book__blurb">{{ blurb | truncatewords: block.settings.blurb_words | escape }}</p>{%- endif -%}
                      <p class="series-book__meta">
                        {%- if book_narrators != blank -%}<span>{{ block.settings.read_by_label | escape }} {{ book_narrators | escape }}</span>{%- endif -%}
                        {%- if book_age != blank -%}<span>{{ block.settings.ages_label | escape }} {{ book_age | escape }}</span>{%- endif -%}
                      </p>
                    </div>

                    <div class="series-book__buy">
                      <p class="series-book__price">
                        {%- if book.compare_at_price > book.price -%}<s class="series-book__was">{{ book.compare_at_price | money }}</s> {% endif -%}
                        {{ book.price | money }}
                      </p>
                      {%- if book.available -%}
                        {%- form 'product', book, is: 'product-form' -%}
                          <input type="hidden" name="id" value="{{ book.selected_or_first_available_variant.id }}">
                          <button type="submit" is="custom-button" class="series-button series-button--primary series-button--small series-button--block" data-series-target="add_book" data-series-product="{{ book.handle | escape }}">{{ 'product.general.add_to_cart_button' | t }}</button>
                        {%- endform -%}
                      {%- else -%}
                        <button type="button" class="series-button series-button--small series-button--block" disabled>{{ 'product.general.sold_out_button' | t }}</button>
                      {%- endif -%}
                      {%- if book.metafields.book.preview != blank -%}
                        <button type="button" class="bookpreview series-button series-button--secondary series-button--small series-button--block" aria-controls="product-sample" aria-expanded="false" data-mp3="{{ book.metafields.book.preview | file_url }}" data-title="{{ book.title | escape }}">
                          <span class="playpause" aria-hidden="true"></span>
                          <span class="series-button__label">{{ block.settings.sample_label | escape }}<span class="sr-only">: {{ book.title | escape }}</span></span>
                        </button>
                      {%- endif -%}
                    </div>
                  </li>
                {%- endfor -%}
              </ol>
            </div>
          </section>
        {%- endif -%}

      {%- when 'characters' -%}
        {%- if character_count > 0 -%}
          <section class="series-characters" {{ block.shopify_attributes }}>
            <div class="container">
              <h2 class="series-heading">{{ block.settings.heading | escape }}</h2>
              <ul class="series-characters__grid" role="list">
                {%- assign shown_keys = '|' -%}
                {%- assign shown = 0 -%}
                {%- for book in source_books -%}
                  {%- assign audiobook = book.metafields.book.audiobook.value -%}
                  {%- if audiobook == blank -%}{%- continue -%}{%- endif -%}
                  {%- for character in audiobook.characters.value -%}
                    {%- assign key = '|' | append: character.system.handle | append: '|' -%}
                    {%- if shown_keys contains key or shown >= block.settings.limit -%}{%- continue -%}{%- endif -%}
                    {%- assign shown_keys = shown_keys | append: character.system.handle | append: '|' -%}
                    {%- assign shown = shown | plus: 1 -%}
                    {%- liquid
                      assign character_text = character.description.value | strip
                      if character_text == blank
                        assign character_text = character.bio | metafield_text | strip | truncatewords: 28
                      endif
                      assign character_photo = character.photos.value | first
                      assign character_url = character.system.url
                    -%}
                    <li class="series-character">
                      <div class="series-character__photo">
                        {%- if character_photo != blank -%}
                          {{- character_photo | image_url: width: 160 | image_tag: loading: 'lazy', sizes: '72px', widths: '72,144,160', alt: '' -}}
                        {%- else -%}
                          {%- comment -%} No photo yet: initials, as in the author and narrator lists {%- endcomment -%}
                          {%- render 'person-avatar', metaobject: character, radius: '50', max_width: 72, avatar_display: 'initials', avatar_bg_color: settings.brand_heading, initials_color: '#ffffff' -%}
                        {%- endif -%}
                      </div>
                      <h3 class="series-character__name">
                        {%- if character_url != blank -%}<a href="{{ character_url }}">{{ character.name.value | escape }}</a>{%- else -%}{{ character.name.value | escape }}{%- endif -%}
                      </h3>
                      {%- if character_text != blank -%}<p class="series-character__text">{{ character_text | escape }}</p>{%- endif -%}
                    </li>
                  {%- endfor -%}
                {%- endfor -%}
              </ul>
            </div>
          </section>
        {%- endif -%}

      {%- when 'about' -%}
        {%- liquid
          assign description_html = series.description | metafield_tag | remove: '<div class="metafield-rich_text_field">' | remove: '</div>'
          assign description_text = description_html | strip_html | strip
          assign paragraphs = description_html | split: '</p>'
          assign lead_count = block.settings.lead_paragraphs
        -%}
        <section class="series-about" {{ block.shopify_attributes }}>
          <div class="container series-about__inner">
            <div class="series-about__text">
              <h2 class="series-heading">{{ block.settings.heading | escape }}</h2>
              {%- if description_text != blank -%}
                <div class="series-about__prose prose">
                  {%- for paragraph in paragraphs -%}
                    {%- if forloop.index > lead_count -%}{%- break -%}{%- endif -%}
                    {%- if paragraph contains '<p' -%}{{ paragraph | append: '</p>' }}{%- endif -%}
                  {%- endfor -%}
                </div>
                {%- if paragraphs.size > lead_count -%}
                  {%- capture more_html -%}
                    {%- for paragraph in paragraphs offset: lead_count -%}
                      {%- if paragraph contains '<p' -%}{{ paragraph | append: '</p>' }}{%- endif -%}
                    {%- endfor -%}
                  {%- endcapture -%}
                  {%- if more_html != blank -%}
                    <details class="series-about__more">
                      <summary>{{ block.settings.more_label | replace: '[name]', series_name | escape }}</summary>
                      <div class="prose">{{ more_html }}</div>
                    </details>
                  {%- endif -%}
                {%- endif -%}
              {%- elsif series.page_description.value != blank -%}
                <div class="series-about__prose prose"><p>{{ series.page_description.value | escape }}</p></div>
              {%- endif -%}
            </div>

            <div class="series-facts">
              <h3 class="series-facts__title">{{ block.settings.facts_heading | escape }}</h3>
              <dl class="series-facts__list">
                {%- if author_list.size > 0 -%}
                  <dt>{{ block.settings.author_label | escape }}</dt>
                  <dd>
                    {%- for name in author_list -%}
                      {%- assign link = author_url_list[forloop.index0] -%}
                      {%- if link != blank and link != '-' -%}<a href="{{ link }}" data-series-target="fact_author">{{ name | escape }}</a>{%- else -%}{{ name | escape }}{%- endif -%}
                      {%- unless forloop.last -%}, {% endunless -%}
                    {%- endfor -%}
                  </dd>
                {%- endif -%}
                {%- if narrator_list.size > 0 -%}
                  <dt>{{ block.settings.narrator_label | escape }}</dt>
                  <dd>
                    {%- for name in narrator_list -%}
                      {%- assign link = narrator_url_list[forloop.index0] -%}
                      {%- if link != blank and link != '-' -%}<a href="{{ link }}" data-series-target="fact_narrator">{{ name | escape }}</a>{%- else -%}{{ name | escape }}{%- endif -%}
                      {%- unless forloop.last -%}, {% endunless -%}
                    {%- endfor -%}
                  </dd>
                {%- endif -%}
                <dt>{{ block.settings.count_label | escape }}</dt>
                <dd>
                  {%- assign count_text = block.settings.count_value | replace: '[count]', book_count -%}
                  {%- if books_anchor != blank -%}<a href="{{ books_anchor }}" data-series-target="fact_books">{{ count_text | escape }}</a>{%- else -%}{{ count_text | escape }}{%- endif -%}
                </dd>
                {%- if reading_level_list.size > 0 -%}
                  <dt>{{ block.settings.age_label | escape }}</dt>
                  <dd>
                    {%- assign ages_text = reading_level_list | join: ', ' | replace: '-', '–' -%}
                    {%- if age_handle != blank -%}<a href="{{ routes.collections_url }}/{{ age_handle }}" data-series-target="fact_age">{{ ages_text | escape }}</a>{%- else -%}{{ ages_text | escape }}{%- endif -%}
                  </dd>
                {%- endif -%}
                {%- if key_stage_list.size > 0 -%}<dt>{{ block.settings.stage_label | escape }}</dt><dd>{{ key_stage_list | join: ', ' | replace: '/', ' and ' | escape }}</dd>{%- endif -%}
                {%- if atos_label != blank -%}<dt>{{ block.settings.atos_label | escape }}</dt><dd>{{ atos_label | escape }}</dd>{%- endif -%}
                {%- if genre_list.size > 0 -%}
                  <dt>{{ block.settings.genre_label | escape }}</dt>
                  <dd>
                    {%- for genre in genre_list limit: 4 -%}
                      {%- assign genre_handle = '' -%}
                      {%- for line in genre_lines -%}
                        {%- assign parts = line | strip | split: '|' -%}
                        {%- if parts.size > 2 -%}
                          {%- assign mapped = parts[0] | strip -%}
                          {%- if mapped == genre -%}{%- assign genre_handle = parts[2] | strip -%}{%- break -%}{%- endif -%}
                        {%- endif -%}
                      {%- endfor -%}
                      {%- if genre_handle != blank -%}<a href="{{ routes.collections_url }}/{{ genre_handle }}" data-series-target="fact_genre">{{ genre | escape }}</a>{%- else -%}{{ genre | escape }}{%- endif -%}
                      {%- unless forloop.last -%}, {% endunless -%}
                    {%- endfor -%}
                  </dd>
                {%- endif -%}
              </dl>
            </div>
          </div>
        </section>

    {%- endcase -%}
  {%- endfor -%}
</div>

{%- if book_count > 0 -%}
  {%- render 'series-jsonld', series: series, series_name: series_name, books: source_books, has_book_list: has_book_list, numbered: numbered, author_list: author_list -%}
{%- endif -%}

<script>
  (function () {
    if (window.__seriesPageClickBound) return;
    window.__seriesPageClickBound = true;
    document.addEventListener('click', function (event) {
      var el = event.target.closest && event.target.closest('[data-series-target]');
      if (!el) return;
      try {
        var page = el.closest('[data-series]');
        if (window.posthog && typeof window.posthog.capture === 'function') {
          window.posthog.capture('series_page_click', {
            target: el.getAttribute('data-series-target'),
            series: page ? page.getAttribute('data-series') : null,
            product: el.getAttribute('data-series-product') || null
          });
        }
      } catch (e) { /* analytics must never get in the way of the click */ }
    });
  })();
</script>

{% schema %}
